  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura Vial de la CVU III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Infrastructure Program CVU III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es financiar la conservacin del patrimonio vial de Uruguay a travs de la contratacion de mantenimiento por resultados, el apalancamiento de inversin privada para la apliacin de capacidad, y la incorporacin de tecnologa para la operacin vial, y la construccin y supervisin de obras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to finance the conservation of Uruguay&apos;s road assets through the contracting of maintenance for results, the leverage of private investment for the application of capacity, and the incorporation of technology for road operation, and the construction and supervision of plays.</narrative>
  </description>
